{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-stm32#card-zh","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-stm32","commit":"95b779b13ca4621836ff951d65b66a6b7e76285b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stm32 是面向 STM32 开发的 DSH 工具插件，通过工具和可选斜杠命令连接工程创建、CubeMX 生成、编译、烧录与调试流程。它能检查本机工具链，创建 CMake 工程骨架，以计划和应用两步修改 .ioc，保留生成文件中的 USER CODE，并返回构建错误与 FLASH/RAM 占用。烧录工具可独立于调试运行，另有寄存器读取、缓存和设备资源管理等能力。适合用 DSH 辅助维护 STM32 固件工程、排查构建或探针问题的开发者；使用时需要安装 DSH、CubeMX、CMake、编译器及相应的调试或烧录工具，部分资源首次使用需下载。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:69-92","src/tools/generate.ts:180-184","src/tools/build.ts:132-136","src/tools/flash.ts:113-117"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-stm32#card-en","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-stm32","commit":"95b779b13ca4621836ff951d65b66a6b7e76285b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-stm32 connects DSH with STM32 project creation, CubeMX generation, CMake builds, flashing, and debugging. Its tools edit .ioc files through a plan and apply flow, preserve USER CODE, and report build errors and memory use. It needs DSH and local tools such as CubeMX and OpenOCD.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:69-92","src/tools/generate.ts:180-184","src/tools/build.ts:132-136","src/tools/flash.ts:113-117"]}
